# Raisoni ERP - Frontend Environment Configuration Example
# Copy to .env.development or .env.production as needed.
#
# Leave VITE_API_URL / VITE_SOCKET_URL UNSET (recommended). The app then calls
# the same origin it was loaded from:
#   - dev:        Vite (port 9091) proxies /api, /uploads, /socket.io to the backend
#   - production: the backend serves the built UI itself on port 2000
#   - desktop:    Electron loads the UI from its bundled backend on 127.0.0.1
# This works on every PC and survives server IP changes.
#
# Only set these if the UI is hosted on a DIFFERENT origin than the backend:
# VITE_API_URL=http://<server-ip>:2000/api
# VITE_SOCKET_URL=http://<server-ip>:2000
